# i3 config for the utm-arch VM (D17), installed by Home Manager (utm-home.nix).
# Colours and fonts: the M3800 theme of 2016 (black bar, coloured focused title)
# in the house style of the assistant repo (INVARIANTS.md I23). utm-arch
# wiki/utm-theme.md says which colour goes where and why.
# Margaret's ~/.config/i3/config of 2020-12-26, copied 2026-09-26, minus the dead
# bindings Super+O, Super+I, Super+Y, Super+Shift+I/U/Y. Super+Return runs Ghostty and
# Super+D runs rofi (both from Nix); xterm and dmenu stay installed from pacman as the
# emergency pair. nm-applet and the feh wallpaper are commented out (absent).


